{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e4f3b2c1-6789-4012-bcde-fg2345678901",
    "name": "Get THB Balance",
    "description": "ดึงยอด THB token ของ wallet address จาก blockchain\n\n## Endpoint Details\n- **Method:** GET\n- **Path:** /wallet/:walletAddress/thb-balance\n- **Auth:** Public (ไม่ต้องใช้ API Key)\n\n## Use Cases\n- ดู THB balance ของ Seller\n- ดู THB balance ของ Customer\n- ดู THB balance ของ Merchant",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get THB Balance",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Response has required fields\", function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.walletAddress).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.currency).to.eql('THB');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.balance).to.exist;",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallet/:walletAddress/thb-balance",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wallet", ":walletAddress", "thb-balance"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "walletAddress",
              "value": "0xaa18f00e63efea1de8b18308bf74b740811b3c0f",
              "description": "Wallet address (0x...)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "ดึงยอด THB token ของ wallet address จาก blockchain\n\n### ข้อดี\n- ไม่ต้องส่ง pointId - ระบบดึงจาก config (THB_ADDRESS)\n- ใช้ได้กับทุก wallet (Seller, Customer, Merchant)"
      },
      "response": [
        {
